<title>USA: Clark County, Nev., to sell $120 mln GOs on Oct 1.</title>
<headline>Clark County, Nev., to sell $120 mln GOs on Oct 1.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clark County, Nev., plans to sell $120 million public safety general obligation bonds on October 1 at 1130 EDT by competitive bids.</p>
<p>The financial adviser on the bonds, due between 1997 and 2017, is Howarth Montague and Associates of Las Vegas.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
